{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"查尔斯·达尔文·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"charles-darwin","categoryLabel":"查尔斯·达尔文","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/29_charles-darwin/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"查尔斯-达尔文的影响与遗产\">查尔斯·达尔文的影响与遗产</h1><p>达尔文的影响早已越出生物学，渗入哲学、宗教、社会与文化的方方面面。本卷从三个维度审视他<strong>身后的遗产与回响</strong>：对生命科学的统一性贡献及其衍生学科、对人类自我认识的重塑、以及由进化论引发并延续至今的科学与宗教之争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>达尔文专题共六卷，彼此分工明确，本卷只谈&quot;影响与遗产&quot;，不重复其他卷的内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、经历了什么</td>\n<td>本卷不叙生平，只谈身后影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>自然选择<strong>是什么</strong>、如何运作</td>\n<td>本卷不证机制，只谈其学科效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么</strong>做科学</td>\n<td>本卷只在谈&quot;科学精神象征&quot;时引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>写了哪些书、内容如何</td>\n<td>本卷引用著作作为影响的证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>影响与遗产（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>学说<strong>改变了什么</strong>、留下什么</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>如何<strong>评判</strong>他的功过</td>\n<td>本卷述影响，争议卷下判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>核心贡献卷讲&quot;理论是什么&quot;，本卷讲&quot;理论之后世界变成了什么样&quot;，争议卷讲&quot;我们该如何评价&quot;。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三章导览\">三章导览</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 <a href=\"impact-on-biology/\">对生物学的影响</a></strong>：进化论如何把零散的生命科学统一进共同框架（<a href=\"impact-on-biology/unifying-the-life-sciences\">统一生命科学</a>），并催生演化医学、生态学等至今活跃的新领域（<a href=\"impact-on-biology/evolutionary-medicine-and-ecology\">演化医学与生态学</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 <a href=\"intellectual-and-social/\">思想与社会冲击</a></strong>：学说如何重塑人类自我形象（<a href=\"intellectual-and-social/reshaping-the-human-self-image\">重塑人类的自我形象</a>），以及&quot;社会达尔文主义&quot;对它的歪曲滥用（<a href=\"intellectual-and-social/social-darwinism-a-misappropriation\">社会达尔文主义的误用</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 <a href=\"science-and-religion/\">科学与宗教</a></strong>：进化论与宗教的长期张力（<a href=\"science-and-religion/the-evolution-creation-debate\">进化论与神创论之争</a>），及达尔文在现代文化中的崇高地位（<a href=\"science-and-religion/darwins-place-in-modern-culture\">达尔文在现代文化中的地位</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/natural-selection/\">核心贡献 · 自然选择</a>，掌握&quot;共同祖先 + 自然选择&quot;两个机制，再读本卷各篇的&quot;影响&quot;才有依托。</p>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：本卷三章可按 学科内 → 社会哲学 → 宗教文化 的扩散半径递进阅读——</p>\n<ol>\n<li>第一章（学科内影响）：理论在生物学内部的统一与衍生，最贴近科学本身。</li>\n<li>第二章（社会哲学冲击）：理论越出学科，改变人对自身的理解，并被误用为意识形态。</li>\n<li>第三章（宗教与文化）：理论与世界观的终极碰撞，及其最终的文化封圣。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>读完本卷后，建议接 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>，把&quot;影响&quot;提升为&quot;评判&quot;。</p>\n<p>理解达尔文的遗产，就是理解一个科学观念如何能够超越其学科，深刻地改变一个文明看待自身与世界的方式。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"impact-on-biology","title":"对生物学的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unifying-the-life-sciences","title":"统一生命科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-biology/unifying-the-life-sciences"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evolutionary-medicine-and-ecology","title":"演化医学与生态学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-biology/evolutionary-medicine-and-ecology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"intellectual-and-social","title":"思想与社会影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/intellectual-and-social","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reshaping-the-human-self-image","title":"重塑人类的自我形象","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/intellectual-and-social/reshaping-the-human-self-image"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-darwinism-a-misappropriation","title":"\"社会达尔文主义\"的误用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/intellectual-and-social/social-darwinism-a-misappropriation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"science-and-religion","title":"科学与宗教","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/science-and-religion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-evolution-creation-debate","title":"进化论与神创论之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/science-and-religion/the-evolution-creation-debate"},{"seq":2,"slug":"darwins-place-in-modern-culture","title":"达尔文在现代文化中的地位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/science-and-religion/darwins-place-in-modern-culture"}]}]}